{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67245885398df745f8d43a64ffdf5068af7fca21343652625ee8920c4785bf4c", "ja": "（今日は桃子の衣装を着たブロマイド撮影だった。\nサイズも問題ないし、かわいく決まってたな！）", "zh": "（今天是桃子穿服装拍相片卡的摄影工作。\n尺寸没有问题，而且拍得非常可爱！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "191d11d69a31f5fe1d20f289f76ffbe3608fbbd92d78388a6cde54c35bd55dc1", "ja": "ふん、ふふ～ん♪", "zh": "哼、哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1002_p", "source_sha256": "329281a020b60c06a5de4554cea384ca844fb440eeee064bebc24e26eebc558b", "ja": "桃子、機嫌がいいんだな。ブログにも書いてたけど、\n今回の衣装、気に入ってるみたいだな？", "zh": "桃子，你看来心情不错喔。你在部落格也有写到，\n这次的服装你好像很喜欢是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "689a7749b765b0e8a09da0c0d2c7e5fb7b01b54a0c1635053faa09f6246a6daf", "ja": "だって、すっごくかわいいし。青羽さんに聞いたけど、\nお兄ちゃんもいろいろアイディア出したんでしょ？", "zh": "因为很可爱呀，而且听青羽姊说，\n大哥哥也出了很多主意，没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "1ec30448be5394caf9d8f0b4a32bfd08c29ca3bfd2298ef87a5f7324f7ee9aa8", "ja": "お兄ちゃんも桃子のこと、\nけっこうわかってきたみたいだね。ほめてあげる♪", "zh": "大哥哥好像也变得很了解桃子了呢，\n桃子就夸奖你一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e9121b1bbddab882f06e4413e252c06a406151c37f8f1849a0abe3e434d09a62", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。そんなに喜んでくれると、\n頑張った甲斐があったなって思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。\n看到你这么开心，就觉得努力得很值得喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "395de31a4b26a8d574a18ca0957985dd5941cbbcdbeed9ca5ec456fd27350784", "ja": "桃子の衣装がかわいいのはもちろんだけど。\n写真撮影楽しかったし、今度のPVも楽しみだし。", "zh": "不只是桃子的服装很可爱，\n拍照也很开心，下次的PV也好令人期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1007_p", "source_sha256": "179daf67653c67175ff6d85ffec00a853601d6f4ba52ba1d0f029fc72ef57596", "ja": "ああ、育と撮った写真は、特にいい笑顔だったな。\n一緒に写真撮れて、楽しかったか？", "zh": "是啊，你跟育拍的照片笑容特别好看呢，\n跟她一起拍照开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "d4cd27c5dff3cfcdaaddcd4ab034033c25a3b8560bdd28f7f6d306531f6023cc", "ja": "うん……って！\nな、なに言ってるの、お兄ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯……呃！\n你、你在说什么啊，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "c60088d4f372472799ce67c131e3aaec1b65d0a63aa416283848acea34d25164", "ja": "桃子はプロなんだよ？　プライベートなこととか、\nお仕事に持ち込んだりしないんだから。", "zh": "桃子是专业的耶！\n才不会把私底下的情绪带到工作上呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fb89a6c3acdd884be7b89a3ad2d649d2b5870c1bf9583a1bd8ab8ee18fa0ec08", "ja": "そうだったのか？　でも、いい表情が撮れたって\nカメラマンさんも言ってたぞ。", "zh": "是吗？\n不过摄影师也说有捕捉到很棒的表情喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "09c6e85abb1b3c71941cdc96fdd6912b78c9ae52fdb600bbe7ca91601a5a8d74", "ja": "お、お仕事はお仕事だもん。\n桃子は、ちゃんとしただけだから……。", "zh": "工、工作就是工作嘛，\n桃子只是把它做好而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5365f401d37c8e75bae875ab8c4cee1007a8d3d508bae1baed5e9e0bcd937367", "ja": "そうか、桃子はさすがだな。\n育はなんだかんだ、はしゃいでたから。", "zh": "这样啊，真不愧是桃子，\n育倒是很兴奋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "f7267afbb7633d58373e1e02e6005de259122b8a02b432e13346c83cea8eca66", "ja": "ふーん……そうなんだ。\n育、そんなにはしゃいでたの？", "zh": "哦……是吗？\n育这么兴奋吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1014_p", "source_sha256": "205a637a4537967a0ea45fe020b55d3b796425b68b3281e2af3824565eec4ff3", "ja": "ああ、すごく楽しみにしてたみたいだ。PV撮影の時も\n休憩時間に桃子と写真を撮るって張り切ってたぞ。", "zh": "对啊，她好像很期待，还精神百倍地说，\n拍摄PV时要趁休息时间跟你拍照呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "7cbd7fc3979e906f03c6255ee0a71baed8652081a84561b80c2643206dae45fc", "ja": "そ、それくらいなら、別にいいけど。\n休憩時間なら、プライベートみたいなものだし……。", "zh": "只、只是那样的话倒是没关系。\n毕竟休息时间算是私人的时间嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a0893b0de79e7c39d835e22de2488f2a636e4691a478e835ac23b5fe45026aa4", "ja": "本当か？　それじゃあ撮影の合間に\nちょっと時間を作ろうか。育もきっと喜ぶぞ。", "zh": "真的吗？那要不要趁拍摄空档抽出一点时间呢？\n育一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "57f1e1f5d032390f6946c626f5e339087162bd5bf5406ad97b4887aa0e39f8d5", "ja": "で、でも！　その時はちゃんと、\nお兄ちゃんがそばにいなきゃダメだからね。", "zh": "可、可是！\n到时候大哥哥必须好好待在桃子身边喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "c3512aab58531e8bdb8e2fc856e2f664e7692a363d7616eca92c0b825fd92cf9", "ja": "桃子たちを放っておいたら、お兄ちゃんの首に\nがぶってかみついて、しもべにしちゃうんだから。", "zh": "要是丢着我们不管，桃子会紧紧咬住大哥哥的脖子，\n把大哥哥变成仆人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f00a856d7fc6ced11cd422d1c6ffc9dc758b1aa506a1774e3fce8ec2f78f8941", "ja": "はは、わかった。\n気を付けて、ちゃんと撮影を見てるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，我知道了，\n我都有注意，很专心在看你拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0144_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "57260dc69b857fc1634751e71c29fc42a805c799aed22ee29b5f4d271da83112", "ja": "うん、いい返事だね。それじゃお兄ちゃん、\n桃子そろそろ着替えるから。また後でね♪", "zh": "嗯，答得好。那么，大哥哥，\n桃子差不多该换衣服了，待会见啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
